    {
      "id": "581539dd-89cf-472d-b435-c2740137e42a",
      "title": "Leia o exemplo e note como a ação entra em uma rotina matinal simples.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 3,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "a413ee83-1085-4d48-a064-3ea5bad5eefc",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>despertarse</strong> fala do momento de acordar.</p><p>Exemplo: <strong>Normalmente, me despierto a las siete en punto.</strong></p><p>Em português: Normalmente, acordo às sete em ponto.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "e8daf19a-23bb-4193-9a12-ba0afe663475",
      "title": "Veja a imagem, escute o áudio e associe a palavra ao momento de levantar da cama.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "7614aee2-dc87-4d25-9acc-d4b8fd29330b",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora veja outra ação da manhã.</p><p><strong>levantarse</strong></p><p>Em português: levantar-se.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/53c17d5f2efb41b981e33f3d3f1f5d5f_levantarse-manana.png?Expires=1794099500&Signature=P0-qEdS32yl2pA2rv5JnQs2OFI0UGkTHRmSyO9dL3iCkt7OXKY3HeOyVEt~i3J-D-UWCzmTryhbRN-pYwutYou8wiZTpeUX0iAL0Yabtqf3oki1XxGNEpA1ZDGRRD-kZTkhBtQWkTDEU3-jm3xSrEhwjs0mPX~biY7ZAfGZBhZ26p4E5IS8oQuka7Ll6AN2FYFDEFVIqvW0Eefe1iU2WFdwW3y8vBcXx6412eHC-Fw7zddcH1ppq3hVQn8dPuFujTlPDMJionr0rxSxYN32RbdqtbP6nzYsuNSXOUuEkHM44RNfun~hT8xSFQHqlyr6-F7zcGpGm3OHGELnzl3QL0w__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/a61ffd78f7a34a5a898506b4349302f7_levantarse.mp3?Expires=1794099500&Signature=l8PnR2vOuRr8AsjI1-ffyh4xs6SST7A8Mipn-GpGW9h8X5tE9bwyUSOD29gSiI8iDMtYlYIxd7N15laax~bBGibpcDjIx0jzqdiCNmvOIM5tuPJXHhv5Kz23kpAbKye7-lXZ7jDY80hS2tyeZcgFXriBaiRs7fXDOCyZfI7TrDJwrrJyGNyrp6cbxsHue25xNDtYYvPP6tqGuVy5-H05IqdFU2DmITt1LknvHx8ARMt0TouQqFbSyOunYrq9Nz2RiGGf3mNdRA4Pf0kxeEmmY9EmFATWng~WYwpRZj3MpPUWsPFCa~5MeVKNDmXnPPYNmYHmRlnIsfy93rMq6MxMkw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
